#   Cargo.lock       -diff linguist-generated

# Binary assets.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.webp  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf   binary

